# Playwright scratch output — traces from failed runs, and the per-screen
# spill counts an update run accumulates before `afterAll` merges them into
# `narrow-baseline.json`. CI uploads what it needs as an artifact; the repo
# tracks only the baseline JSON.
#
# Sibling of tests/a11y/.gitignore and tests/visual/.gitignore. This one
# arrived late: G0-9 gave this directory its first output and the pattern was
# not copied across, so a `git add tests/` swept sixteen scratch files into a
# commit.
.output/
